Try the following:

IDDQD - GOD Mode
idkfa - Very happy ammo for all ammo and keys
iddt - for map detail (only when you are in the map [tab] area)
       twice for full detail including where creatures are
idmypos - coordinates
idclip - to walk through walls
idchoppers - for stupid messages
idclevxx (for DOOM II only) to jump levels

